                            <comment id="15516608" author="moon" created="Fri, 23 Sep 2016 14:30:58 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;English translation of description, for you convenience:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Error &quot;Blocking message pending 10000 for BLOCKING&quot; occurs frequently when i schedule my Note 5 min interval. My note uses spark interpreter and angular interpreter with some of AngularDisplay system features (such as z.runParagraphs() when user gives input) and JDBC, Markdown interpreter as well. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15516633" author="moon" created="Fri, 23 Sep 2016 14:42:30 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I think this issue is related to &lt;a href=&quot;https://blogs.oracle.com/PavelBucek/entry/is_websocket_session_really_thread&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://blogs.oracle.com/PavelBucek/entry/is_websocket_session_really_thread&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;
I guess synchronize &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/master/zeppelin-server/src/main/java/org/apache/zeppelin/socket/NotebookSocket.java#L68&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;NotebookSocket.send()&lt;/a&gt; would solve the problem.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
